From d9dc1689f92d5e4e10a7f7916859fbf0e8981843 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Xbox360 Blades <xbox360-blades@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 23:50:00 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 02/51] Guide overlay: exact-size images, scripted test mode

Resample the Guide images (rendered at 2 px/unit) to the on-screen size on a
background thread with an area filter and draw them one texel per pixel, instead
of letting the GPU minify them (skipped texels, shimmering text at 720p, and a
53 ms stall per image mid-animation).

Debounce Guide releases shorter than 80 ms (keyboard driver focus glitches).

--blades_guide_test=<ms>,<page>[,black][,+button[*hold]]... opens the Guide and
presses buttons by itself for screenshots and pixel comparisons.
